sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant Storage as Secure Storage
    participant API as API Server
    participant DB as Database

    Note over User,DB: Diagram 9 — Make a Reservation

    User->>App: Select booking type
    User->>App: Select date from calendar
    User->>App: Select time slot(s)

    Note over App: App calculates total price locally

    User->>App: Tap "Confirm Reservation"
    App-->>User: Show confirmation dialog
    Note right of App: Displays: type, date, time, total price

    alt User confirms
        App->>Storage: Read auth_token
        Storage-->>App: JWT token

        App->>+API: POST /bookings
        Note right of App: Header: Authorization Bearer token
        Note right of App: Body: {booking_type_id, date, start_time, end_time}

        API->>DB: Check user balance is sufficient
        API->>DB: Check slot is still available

        alt Phone number not verified
            DB-->>API: Phone missing
            API-->>App: 4xx — Phone verification required
            App-->>User: Show error: verify phone number in settings
        else Insufficient balance
            DB-->>API: Balance too low
            API-->>App: 402 — Insufficient balance
            App-->>User: Show insufficient balance error
        else Slot already taken (race condition)
            DB-->>API: Slot conflict
            API-->>App: 409 — Time slot no longer available
            App-->>User: Show slot conflict error
        else Booking successful
            DB->>DB: Deduct price from user balance
            DB->>DB: Create booking record
            DB-->>API: Booking created
            API-->>App: 200 — Booking confirmed
            App-->>User: Show success notification
            App->>App: Clear calendar selections
            App->>+API: GET /bookings/occupied-slots
            API-->>App: Updated availability data
            App-->>User: Refresh calendar view
        end
    else User cancels
        App-->>User: Cancel reservation
    end